 δύο ειδών Fritillaria, τα οποία απαντούν εκεί [Kamari 1986 (1993)].","","text","",""]]},"VCJC8":{"d":[["Habitat and distribution: — Zingiber edule is currently known only from its type locality and nearby areas, which grows on sandstone soil, in moist, half-shaded areas under evergreen broad-leaved forest.","","text","",""]]},"Y6HG":{"d":[["","SIE-OO","tdwg","native",""],["","ZAI-OO","tdwg","native",""],["Zaire, Sierra Leone","","text","native",""]]},"ZFDZ":{"d":[["Russia (Siberia) [early Cretaceous]","","text","native",""]]}}